connectome, possibly including subtypes like pC1a and pC1c, and I want to trace the sensory pathway that feeds 
into it via pheromone detection.

I'm mapping out the pheromone pathways: gustatory cVA detection through OR67d receptors, and cuticular hydrocarbon 
sensing through foreleg Gr/ppk neurons, both converging ascending signals onto pC1. I'll also describe pIP10 as 
the descending song command neuron downstream of pC1, and trace those connections together.



